{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"Coordinate clicks move nearby markers, and matching markers merge into the next size. Each click also moves a separate outlined object; action 7 undoes the click. The existing merge leg stalled on a clone, so I’ll trace the cause before extending it."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > probe_merge.py <<'PY'\nimport json, math\nimport gkm_try as h\nfrom perception import connected_components,safe_step\n\ndef markers(e):return [b for b in connected_components(e.frame(),colors=[10,6,15,11]) if b.bbox[0]>=10]\ndef desc(e):return [(b.color,b.bbox[2:]) for b in markers(e)]\ndef probe(e):\n for a in json.load(open('checkpoint.json'))['final_path']:e.step(a)\n c=e.clone();path=[]\n for i in range(65):\n  bs=markers(c)\n  pairs=[(math.dist(a.centroid,b.centroid),a,b) for j,a in enumerate(bs) for b in bs[j+1:] if a.color==b.color]\n  if not pairs:break\n  _,a,b=min(pairs,key=lambda p:p[0]);y,x=a.bbox[2:];ty,tx=b.bbox[2:];d=math.hypot(ty-y,tx-x);s=min(3,d)\n  act=(6,round(x+(tx-x)*s/d),round(y+(ty-y)*s/d));safe_step(c,act);path.append(act)\n  print(i,act,desc(c),'agent',[(z.bbox) for z in connected_components(c.frame(),colors=[7])], 'level',c.levels_completed)\n  if desc(c)==[(z.color,z.bbox[2:]) for z in bs]:break\n print('PATH',path)\nh.A.run_program('su15',probe)\nPY\npython probe_merge.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
